WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:04.170
-I woke up this morning and I
said to myself, "I am screwed.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.672 line:92%
I'm gonna be on this show."

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.773 line:92%
And I turn on the computer,

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:10.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there is a sinkhole
at the White House.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:10.410 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.912
-And I said, "Damn, I don't have
a sinkhole joke.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, no.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.119
-Oh, that's what happens
when you drain the swamp.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:19.686 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-There you go.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But that's a joke
everybody would be doing.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.790
-Do you think if you were still
doing your show,

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.459
you would make jokes about
Donald Trump every second?

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:30.263
-I tell ya, after watching
the opening of your show,

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
there would be no point in me
doing it.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you seem to have it
covered, my friend.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's -- Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:40.540 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-And I don't do --

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.875 line:92%
All I do is Jimmy Stewart.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Imitating Jimmy Stewart]
"Harvey."

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.146 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-That's really good.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Normal voice ]
But it is Mike Pence,

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this is what troubles me
about Mike Pence.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:54.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's the Vice President.
-Yeah.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.155 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:56.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He is from Indiana.
-Yeah.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.526 line:92%
-And I've been thinking about --

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:03.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
He looks like the guy
at a funeral home

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:07.133
that would try to sell you
the most expensive casket.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:07.667 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:11.004
That's what he is. Isn't he?
-Yeah. Yeah, very earnestly.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:11.571 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, yeah. No.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:16.342
-You want your loved ones --
-Exactly, to spend eternity...

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.912 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:19.612 line:92%
How's your father-in-law?

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:23.216
You married a woman whose father
teaches goats to surf.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:23.650 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.617 line:92%
-How many surfing goats you got?

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:26.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Here is a picture of
my father-in-law.

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:29.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm glad you brought it up
because when I first --

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first time as a guest
on your show,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:32.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
I told a story
about at the time,

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:36.563
the father of a woman I was
dating and his pet goat Raisin.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Raisin
did surf at one point.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:41.468
And we talked about it
every time I came on your show.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
Now, wait a minute.

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.604 line:92%
Is this your wife's father?

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.305 line:92%
-That's my wife's father.

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:47.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, because you said the girl
you were dating.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:50.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought, "Oh, crap,
I've stepped in it again."

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:50.877 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I'm glad you said it
because I -- you know,

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:54.681 line:92%
when I first started dating her,

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.416 size:78% position:39%
I went on your show,
told this goat story.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:59.486
And the next time I came on your
show, I remember them saying,

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:01.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
"If you have more stories
about the goat,

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.056 line:92%
Dave would love to hear it."

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:03.857 line:92%
And that's when I realized,

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:06.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm gonna have to stick with
this girl because I'm --

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't run out of
goat stories. Yeah."

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:13.466
-But now, I was hoping coming
here tonight, I had many hopes.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:16.202 line:92%
But chief among them was the --

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:20.306
I wanted to see the goat
actually up riding a wave.

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:22.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I have some news
about the goat.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:23.910 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, no.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The goat passed away.
[ Audience awws ]

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:27.747 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Here's an obituary.

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:28.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:31.417
But I think you'll be very --
-"Goat that led two lives."

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:34.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Words that have never
been printed

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.555 line:92%
in the history of language.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I think
you'll appreciate this

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
because the goat obviously
meant so much to you.

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:41.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is -- you know,
this is in an actual obituary.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Raisin was
a local and national celebrity

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:46.566
admired both by his owner
and the island community,

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:49.068
and a much wider audience
after he was featured on

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
'The Late Show
with David Letterman.'"

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:51.604 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
So that -- you know,
that's something for you.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.941 line:92%
You made a goat's obituary.

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:56.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
But...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:01.915 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.915 --> 00:03:03.483 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah!

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:09.222
But to be sure,
you actually saw the goat surf?

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.256 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Now, don't lie to me.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:13.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to know
if the goat actually surfed.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.828 line:92%
-The goat stood on a surfboard.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:17.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I'm pretty sure
the surfboard

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:20.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
was more on the ground
than the wave.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:25.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, this goat passed away
everyone.

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:26.239 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's right.
-Don't speak ill of the dead.

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:31.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Talking about a dead goat,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.478 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:34.447 line:92%
I got something for you, buddy.

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:36.849 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What do you got?

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:41.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Anybody here
ever had Lyme disease?

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a --
I'm doing this to promote

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:45.792 align:start size:94% position:6%
epidemiological health
and awareness,

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:49.495
because the Lyme disease,
the ticks are everywhere.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:50.830 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I've had Lyme disease.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have?
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:55.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
Probably got it now.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:57.937 size:75% position:38%
-You look like a guy
who would have it.

00:03:57.937 --> 00:04:02.909 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.644 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I've had Ehrlichiosis.

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:07.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the third one
would be babesiosis,

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:09.115 line:92%
and that's the hat trick.

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:09.649 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:16.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I pulled this off
my lower back Monday morning.

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.324 line:92%
And he's been in this bag since.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:18.925 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, this is --

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-These are tenacious
little bastards.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:27.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you brought a tick?
[ Laughs ]

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:27.934 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-There.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:31.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is a --
That's a live tick.

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:34.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because now, how long was it
on you, would you say?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
-At least overnight.
-Yeah.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:36.776 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So are you gonna have --

00:04:36.776 --> 00:04:38.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But see, look,
he's still alive.

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:40.980 line:92%
He was sealed in a Ziploc bag.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:41.581 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And by the way,

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:45.718
don't you think I get a little
money from the Ziploc people?

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:48.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter and applause ]
Come on.

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:52.158 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just a little --

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:53.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you gonna
have this tested?

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because now they can test it,
right?

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:58.364 size:78% position:39%
And find out if it --
[ Audience groans ]

00:04:58.364 --> 00:04:59.966 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:01.834 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-What a bunch of babies.

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:02.402 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:04.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I'm not gonna
have him tested.

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:06.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's yours.
-Oh, wow.

00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:08.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know --
-You have him tested.

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:10.977 line:92%
You're the man with the show.

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:11.511 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I could use my budget.
-Yeah, that's right. Yeah.

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:16.149 line:92%
-Well, I have to be honest.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of all the gifts
anyone's ever brought,

00:05:18.217 --> 00:05:20.653 size:88% position:44%
and I thought, you know,
what I really thought,

00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:22.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
I owed you for the legacy
of this show

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:23.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the fact that
if you hadn't started,

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:25.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wouldn't be here,
but really --

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:27.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, I keep forgetting
about that

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
because your show
is nothing like my show.

00:05:30.363 --> 00:05:35.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
My show was lumpy and viscous.
-Beautifully so.

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:41.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And your show is crisp
and smart and contemporary.

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:44.210 line:92%
And it's just lovely, so --

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:51.484 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:52.018 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-He agrees.

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:54.020 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're the fifth host
of this show.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:54.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fourth.
-Fifth.

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:56.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Tomorrow Show" -- Tom Snyder.
-Oh, right. Yep.

00:05:56.856 --> 00:06:03.296
-Then myself, then Conan,
then Jimmy Fallon, and now you.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:04.197 line:92%
-Yeah. And you think tomorrow --

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:06.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
you think a better show title
would have been

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:07.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Tomorrow Show"?
-Absolutely.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:12.238
Because Pat Weaver, a gentleman
who is Sigourney Weaver's father

00:06:12.238 --> 00:06:15.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
worked at NBC in, I think,
promotion,

00:06:15.441 --> 00:06:16.809 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and had this strategy of

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:18.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Today," "Tonight"
and "Tomorrow."

00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:22.181
And I begged you
when you took over this show --

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:23.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did.
-Change it!

00:06:23.316 --> 00:06:25.818 align:start size:94% position:6%
But anyway, why not
"The Tomorrow Show"?

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:28.755 size:88% position:44%
-Yeah, it's -- you know,
I -- I thought about it.

00:06:28.755 --> 00:06:29.455 size:75% position:38% line:92%
But you what it was?

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:32.592
It meant a lot to me to be
another host of "Late Night."

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:33.259 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, God bless you.

00:06:33.259 --> 00:06:35.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
Isn't he the nicest man
in the world?

00:06:35.495 --> 00:06:36.229 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:37.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I really appreciate you
being here.

00:06:37.864 --> 00:06:38.998 line:92%
I really appreciated this.

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:39.665 size:75% position:38% line:92%
We're gonna keep it.

00:06:39.665 --> 00:06:41.467
I'm gonna give to it
the next host of this franchise,

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:43.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
whenever that happens.
-Great success.

00:06:43.302 --> 00:06:45.938 line:92%
-David Letterman, everybody!

